Drukkerijen-flow: imprimeurs CRUD + bons de production + auto-trigger paid

Geport van allardphilippe (0023_suppliers + lib + admin pages),
volledig in shop.* schema voor jp-montreuil.

DB (migration 0026):
- shop.suppliers (name, email, phone, default_for_media[], notes,
  is_active, sort_order)
- shop.supplier_order_status enum (pending->sent->acked->in_production
  ->received_by_studio, of cancelled)
- shop.supplier_orders (1-op-1 per shop.order_items via UNIQUE
  constraint), met sent_at/acked_at/received_at/cancelled_at,
  external_ref, signed_url_expires_at, notes
- RLS authed-all (admin via service-role)

Libs:
- lib/shop/suppliers.ts: listSuppliers, getSupplierById,
  getDefaultSupplierFor (per medium-slug)
- lib/shop/supplier-orders.ts: listSupplierOrders, getById, getDetail,
  createSupplierOrdersForOrder (idempotent), setSupplierOrderStatus,
  reassignSupplier, updateSupplierOrderNotes, sendSupplierOrderEmail
  (genereert 30-dagen signed URL voor hi-res Storage foto, rendert
  bon-de-commande HTML in jp-montreuil bronze/paper stijl)

Admin pages (in nieuwe sidebar links onder Boutique):
- /admin/boutique/imprimeurs/ : lijst met active/inactive badges +
  default-media tags + notes preview
- /admin/boutique/imprimeurs/nouveau : create form
- /admin/boutique/imprimeurs/[id] : edit + delete (SupplierForm met
  4 media-checkboxes, sort_order, is_active, notes)
- /admin/boutique/production/ : alle bons met filter pills (En cours
  / pending / sent / ... / Toutes), kolommen status/commande/tirage/
  imprimeur/datum
- /admin/boutique/production/[id] : detail met foto-preview, specs,
  status-actions per fase, imprimeur-assignment dropdown (in pending),
  klant-info, external_ref + notes inputs, en complete timeline
  (creee/envoyee/confirmee/en production/recue/annulee/lien expire)

Auto-trigger:
- /admin/boutique/orders/actions.ts updateOrderStatus(status='paid')
  roept createSupplierOrdersForOrder() aan -> per print-order_item
  (photo_id + print_media_slug not null) wordt een bon aangemaakt met
  default-imprimeur (op basis van print_media_slug). Niet fataal bij
  fout.
- /api/shop/mollie-webhook idem -> wanneer Mollie status->paid update,
  triggert ook createSupplierOrdersForOrder().

